@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF5F6
skinparam classBorderColor #183D50
skinparam ArrowColor #183D50
hide empty members
hide footbox
actor Guest
participant "controller:\nRentalController" as C
participant "service:\nRentalService" as S
participant "storage:\nStorageHandler" as H
participant "renderer:\nRentalRenderer" as R
Guest -> C : reserve(request)
activate C
C -> S : reserve(request)
activate S
note over S
 Validate guest, apartment, dates and capacity.
 Recheck availability and calculate price.
 Create Reservation in an independent
 candidate snapshot (domain calls summarized).
end note
S -> H : save(candidate)
activate H
H --> S : SaveResult(OK)
deactivate H
note over S : Accept saved candidate as current state.
S --> C : Result(OK, reservation)
deactivate S
C -> R : render(result)
activate R
R --> C : screen updated
deactivate R
C --> Guest : Result(OK, reservation)
deactivate C
@enduml
